   3.820002073686*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b8bcf8bc-9b91-4b7a-ac4a-e555a8deb86e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "4.- Realizar cuatro iteraciones por el m\[EAcute]todo de Newton para \
aproximar la soluci\[OAcute]n de la ecuaci\[OAcute]n ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["x", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a0cf8874-1112-477c-b87f-4eb240a21d32"],
 "+2x+1=0 partiendo de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["x", "0"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c08790c7-13f6-4643-9458-8d202130d4e0"],
 "=-2. El valor de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["x", "4"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "31560754-5acb-4057-b1e8-b89d85535bf3"],
 " con 10 cifras decimales es: \n\n\n\n\n\n1) -0.4540793328, 2) 0.4540792113, \
3) -0.4540790157, 4) -0.4540796425, 5) -0.4540792217"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.610967983265625*^9, 3.610968082640625*^9}, {
